{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe club charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The amount of this contribution is fixed in the annex of the charter[[cite:obs-2cc5ab1f488b2ab2f6796abbd04596f21b331a57 \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]].\n\nAccording to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January[[cite:obs-31d60088773677cdfd1775ff9a6573fed3faf42c \"Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added statements about the membership fee and the annual amount paid by members, each supported by exact quotes from the charter and annex sources as required."}